WEBVTT

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:40.160
We're still not to the city yet?

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:42.870
Exactly when are we going to get there?

00:01:42.870 --> 00:01:45.790
I don't think we're
going in the wrong direction.

00:01:45.790 --> 00:01:48.790
Chrono, the map is upside down.

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:51.590
Hey, are you all right? Get a grip!

00:01:51.590 --> 00:01:53.090
Right.

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:57.510
If we could just get a ride somewhere,

00:01:57.510 --> 00:02:01.180
we'd be arriving in San Francisco by now.

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:04.020
There isn't anyone around, is there?

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:08.390
There's supposed to be a gas station
ahead, so let's push on until we get there.

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:09.400
Okay!

00:02:15.940 --> 00:02:16.990
That's...

00:02:16.990 --> 00:02:18.240
It couldn't be.

00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:19.450
Lucky us!

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:22.280
Hey! Stop!

00:02:25.330 --> 00:02:27.620
Hey!

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:36.550
It went by! Oh, and it was our chance too!

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:37.510
This is your fault,

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:39.430
because you weren't reading the map right!

00:02:39.430 --> 00:02:40.840
What are we going to do?!

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:54.900
Satella!

00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:57.570
What are you doing in a place like this?!

00:02:57.570 --> 00:03:00.780
What I do and where
I do it is no concern of yours.

00:03:02.740 --> 00:03:07.450
All things considered,
you three are even dirtier than usual.

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:11.000
Miss Satella, you're as beautiful as ever!

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:16.840
Az, you're so honest.
Maybe I should invite you to my villa.

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:21.220
Azmaria is astounding,
already cozying up to rich folk at her age.

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:25.810
You saved us, Miss Satella.

00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:27.720
Yes, really. Thank you.

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:31.390
I'm amazed.
You were going to walk to San Francisco?

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:32.850
That's pretty brave of you.

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:34.400
We didn't have any choice.

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:37.860
All of our luggage
got carried off on that train.

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:41.110
Could it be that you're all penniless?

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:45.370
Well, excuse us! Unlike you, Princess,
we don't have any spare time or money!

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:48.620
Well, I don't have any time at all either.

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:52.210
Though I do have money to burn.

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:57.000
Rosette, calm down!

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:59.260
Sit quietly!

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:06.970
It's San Francisco!

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:10.980
Please wake up, Rosette! Hey, Rosette!

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:13.390
We've arrived?!

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:16.190
Chrono, you come along too.

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:20.820
Sorry, I'll be right there, so go ahead.

00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:23.530
Really? Okay, I'm going ahead!

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:32.200
It's beautiful!

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:35.750
This place has
the best view in San Francisco.

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:42.590
All right!

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:44.220
Let's do it!

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:51.430
Chrono, how long are
you going to stay half-asleep?

00:04:51.430 --> 00:04:52.730
Now that we've arrived in 'Cisco,

00:04:52.730 --> 00:04:55.060
if you don't snap to, we'll be in trouble!

00:04:58.150 --> 00:05:00.730
Chrono, what have you done?

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:04.860
Cut him to pieces! <i>Mutigster!</i>

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:10.660
Whoa, that looks like it hurts.

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:13.660
Chrono is bolder than he looks, isn't he?

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:16.250
Jeez, what was he thinking?

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:20.170
Hey, you! Exactly what kind
of training are you giving him?!

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:23.090
Now, now. I'll be sure to scold him harshly.

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:24.220
That's why devils are...

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:27.220
Rosette! It's horrible!

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:28.390
Chrono has...

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:31.350
...a horrible fever.

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:32.600
A fever?

00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:37.850
All you have to do is slap
a bandage on him and he'll be fine.

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:41.440
Miss Satella, could you please take
us to the Magdalene branch office?

00:05:42.520 --> 00:05:44.190
Sure, that's fine.

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:49.820
Why don't we take him to
the villa instead? It's very close.

00:05:49.820 --> 00:05:51.200
Please do!

00:05:58.870 --> 00:06:03.840
I'm sorry, Rosette. We're so close
to being able to see Joshua, yet...

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:05.210
What are you talking about?

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:07.970
Sick people don't have to
think about things like that.

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:11.350
More importantly,
right now, getting better comes first.

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:18.640
How is he?

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:24.110
He's asleep.
Az and Steiner are with him right now.

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:25.110
I see.

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:30.410
Come to think of it, this is the first time
Chrono's ever had anything like a fever.

00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:33.240
It has to be because
his legion are activating.

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:34.410
Legion?

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:38.790
His body's constructed
the same as other devils, right?

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:40.420
When they take damage,

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:43.540
their power works to try
and restore their health quickly.

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:47.130
Are you listening to what I'm saying?!

00:06:47.130 --> 00:06:49.760
I am listening.

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:50.630
I wonder.

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:53.640
All we need to do is reduce his fever, right?

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:55.890
There's no point in
thinking too hard about it.

00:06:57.310 --> 00:06:59.440
I'm going to go buy a fever reducer!

00:07:00.270 --> 00:07:02.480
Seriously, she is such a simple girl.

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:05.940
Miss Satella,
did Rosette go out somewhere?

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:06.820
I suppose.

00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:08.780
Oh my, by herself?

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:10.110
Yes, why?

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:19.370
Seriously, why did you just dash off
without knowing where the pharmacy is?

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:22.120
I couldn't help myself,
it just occurred to me.

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:25.790
Haven't you ever heard of
something called thinking before you act?

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:29.130
And exactly how long are you
planning on wearing that filthy thing?

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:32.680
If you don't hurry up and change
your clothes, you're going to rot.

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:34.220
I don't need your advice!

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:36.140
Hold on, don't get so close.

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:42.230
But you're kinder than
I thought, helping me like this.

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:44.860
What are you talking about?

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:48.070
If you did this alone, there's
no telling how long it would take!

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:50.650
I just want Chrono to get well soon,

00:07:50.650 --> 00:07:53.740
so you can all hurry up
and get out of my house.

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:57.200
We'll get out even without you telling us to!

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:00.450
We're here.

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:02.660
Here?

00:08:02.660 --> 00:08:05.750
Yes, this place should
have most medicines in stock.

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:11.800
Take care.

00:08:13.470 --> 00:08:15.390
Are you looking for something?

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:19.100
Yes.

00:08:19.100 --> 00:08:21.020
What are you looking for?

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:22.770
Well...

00:08:27.730 --> 00:08:29.780
Please, tell me.

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:43.500
Hurry up and tell him already!

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:45.370
All right already!

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:50.420
Do you have a fever reducer
that would even work on a devil?

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:56.430
What did you just say?

00:08:58.430 --> 00:09:00.140
Sorry to have bothered you!

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:05.390
Ow ow ow ow ow! Let me go already!

00:09:05.390 --> 00:09:07.860
What kind of idiot would say
something as straightforward as that?!

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:09.730
What else could I say?

00:09:09.730 --> 00:09:11.900
There are any number of
other ways to say it, right?

00:09:13.030 --> 00:09:17.280
And besides, this is medicine for Chrono.
A normal store isn't going to work!

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:24.040
This shop has
a reputation for effective medicines.

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:29.960
Hey, isn't this place closed?
It's pitch dark inside.

00:09:29.960 --> 00:09:32.420
I don't think it's supposed to be.

00:09:32.420 --> 00:09:33.460
It's open.

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:39.390
What is with this store?!

00:09:42.310 --> 00:09:44.770
Wait, what the heck?! It won't open!

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:46.770
No way!

00:09:46.770 --> 00:09:48.270
Wait a second, why?!

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:58.610
Oh, I'm sorry.
I didn't mean to scare you

00:09:58.610 --> 00:10:00.780
Any normal person would be scared!

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:02.450
Now, now, let's see...

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:06.210
A powerful fever reducer that
would even work on a devil, right?

00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:09.250
Choose whichever ones you like.

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:14.710
Do you have any that
might be easier to take?

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:17.630
Easier to take...

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:20.640
Then this would be my recommendation.

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:34.230
What was that?!

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:37.030
I can't give that to Chrono!

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:38.900
Well, that was a waste of time.

00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:41.240
Let's go home already.

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:43.080
What? Wait a second!

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:45.490
There are still other pharmacies, right?

00:10:45.490 --> 00:10:48.000
No matter how many
we go to, they'll all be the same.

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:49.500
Hey, what are you...

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:50.870
They're not the same!

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:56.260
I understand! Goodness...

00:10:56.670 --> 00:10:58.760
Please, can you do something about that?

00:11:06.640 --> 00:11:07.680
Go home!

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:10.640
Ow ow ow...

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:12.730
Isn't it about time you gave up?

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:15.400
No matter where we've gone,
no one's taken you seriously.

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:18.570
And there's no medicine that
works on devils in the first place.

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:20.200
Magic might be a different story, but...

00:11:21.150 --> 00:11:22.200
Magic?!

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:26.540
Wait a second.

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:28.750
What are you planning on doing,
coming to a place like this?

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:30.210
I have an idea!

00:11:30.660 --> 00:11:31.830
Wait!

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:35.790
Hey, don't just stop all of the sudden!

00:11:38.510 --> 00:11:40.590
Satella, I'm going in here, okay?

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:42.720
Fortune telling?!

00:11:43.180 --> 00:11:50.140
I shall see your destiny reflected
in this, and tell you what you should do.

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:51.600
Now, I shall look.

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:53.400
Please do.

00:11:53.400 --> 00:11:54.610
Quickly, all right?

00:12:01.570 --> 00:12:03.240
Granny?

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:05.070
Hey, Granny?

00:12:05.070 --> 00:12:06.490
What can you see?

00:12:09.290 --> 00:12:12.290
The future isn't easy to see.

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:18.090
By the way, there's an important ally,
a friend, that is ill, is there not?

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:19.170
Yes.

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:22.420
He seems to be suffering
terrible nightmares due to his fever.

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:25.840
At the very least, let me
tell you a charm to reduce his fever.

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:35.850
Wait a second, Rosette! Stop!

00:12:40.150 --> 00:12:42.860
What an unfortunate destiny.

00:12:49.280 --> 00:12:50.410
We're back.

00:12:52.950 --> 00:12:54.290
Welcome back!

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:56.670
How is Chrono doing?

00:12:56.670 --> 00:12:58.540
He's sleeping right now.

00:12:59.170 --> 00:13:00.250
I see.

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:02.840
Did they have any medicine?

00:13:02.840 --> 00:13:05.630
Oh, it was crazy.

00:13:05.630 --> 00:13:08.050
She mercilessly dragged me
all over the place, and worse,

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:11.220
she even made me go with her to
this suspicious fortune teller. I'm exhausted!

00:13:11.220 --> 00:13:15.190
And in the end,
what we bought was normal cold medicine.

00:13:15.190 --> 00:13:19.730
A fortune teller? What did she
say was in your future, Rosette?

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:23.150
A charm to reduce fevers.

00:13:23.990 --> 00:13:25.320
A charm?

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:27.110
Well...

00:13:27.110 --> 00:13:30.200
Oh, that's right!
I have to go prepare our food!

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:42.880
You guys, each and every
one of you, really are all...

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:44.550
What the hell is going on?

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:47.430
Don't tell me that you have a fever too!

00:13:47.430 --> 00:13:48.640
She has a fever!

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:54.220
Seriously...

00:13:54.220 --> 00:13:55.350
I can't believe this.

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:57.730
What's the point if you pass out too?

00:13:57.730 --> 00:13:59.020
Sorry.

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:02.400
This is no laughing matter.

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:04.230
You're mean! You hit me!

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:05.820
Hurry up and go to sleep.

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:09.820
Rosette, are you all right?

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:18.540
You're going to make it?

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:19.370
Yes!

00:14:19.370 --> 00:14:23.420
I want to do something
for Rosette and Chrono too!

00:14:23.420 --> 00:14:24.380
Steiner...

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:25.260
Yes, milady

00:14:25.260 --> 00:14:28.470
It's all right!
Please let me do it by myself!

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:36.310
All right, this is where I show off my skills!

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:39.850
Are you all right?

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:43.860
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:45.570
As long as you're not hurt, it's all right.

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:46.530
Okay!

00:14:49.490 --> 00:14:53.280
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry...!

00:15:08.340 --> 00:15:10.010
It's finished!

00:15:16.140 --> 00:15:18.390
This is incredible, Azmaria!

00:15:18.390 --> 00:15:20.350
I hope it suits their tastes.

00:15:20.350 --> 00:15:23.860
It'll be fine!
I'm sure that they'll be delighted.

00:15:23.860 --> 00:15:26.730
Let's take it to them before it gets cold.

00:15:26.730 --> 00:15:27.730
Okay!

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:32.070
Chrono...

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:36.160
How do you feel?

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:37.540
Azmaria...

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:42.870
Your fever still hasn't gone down, has it?

00:15:42.870 --> 00:15:45.750
Eating is important
in order to help you get better!

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:50.800
Wow! You made all this, Azmaria?

00:15:50.800 --> 00:15:52.720
I'm not sure if it will
suit your tastes or not, but...

00:15:54.640 --> 00:15:55.720
It's delicious!

00:15:56.640 --> 00:15:58.060
Thank goodness.

00:15:58.060 --> 00:16:00.180
Well then, please take your time eating it.

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:02.310
I'll come get the dishes later.

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:03.980
Thank you, Azmaria.

00:16:04.860 --> 00:16:06.310
Azmaria...

00:16:06.310 --> 00:16:07.270
Yes?

00:16:07.270 --> 00:16:08.730
Where's Rosette?

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:10.400
Well, that is...

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:11.400
Azmaria?

00:16:18.030 --> 00:16:20.750
Hey! Eat slowly!

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:23.710
A fever?!

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:28.840
But her appetite is not weakening.
Just what I'd expect from Rosette.

00:16:28.840 --> 00:16:29.800
Yes.

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:34.430
That was delicious.

00:16:34.430 --> 00:16:36.550
Are you really sick?

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:37.550
Yeah.

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:39.850
Satella...

00:16:40.680 --> 00:16:42.680
How is Chrono doing?

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:45.230
It looks like his fever still isn't going down.

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:47.810
Regular medicine really isn't good enough.

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:51.860
What is it?

00:16:51.860 --> 00:16:53.820
I'm just not myself.

00:16:55.610 --> 00:16:57.700
I need him to get better soon.

00:16:58.410 --> 00:17:00.990
Could it be that you two...

00:17:00.990 --> 00:17:04.080
It's a problem if there's
no one to carry the bags.

00:17:05.830 --> 00:17:09.040
And this town has a lot
of hills, so you get tired, you know?

00:17:09.040 --> 00:17:10.960
What is Chrono, your servant?!

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:14.760
If he doesn't get better soon,
we can't go look for Joshua either.

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:16.220
I mean, seriously...

00:17:20.310 --> 00:17:22.890
Seriously, she is an appalling girl.

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:26.850
I'm sure that's because she's so worried
about Chrono that she can't help herself.

00:17:27.770 --> 00:17:30.070
Because that's the way
Rosette's personality is,

00:17:30.070 --> 00:17:33.230
she won't just come out
and say it, but the truth is...

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:39.780
...Chrono is always
concerned about Rosette too.

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:44.120
Even when they're apart,
they think about each other.

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:45.830
I think that's wonderful.

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:52.630
I think that maybe
the best medicine for Chrono

00:17:52.630 --> 00:17:56.090
would be for Rosette to be by his side.

00:18:04.430 --> 00:18:06.270
Wait a second, Azmaria!

00:18:06.270 --> 00:18:08.270
Oh, no, not you too!

00:18:11.560 --> 00:18:13.940
She is resting now.

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:17.070
I see, so she was just sleepy.

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:18.110
Yes.

00:18:18.110 --> 00:18:21.280
Thank goodness. I was worried
that she might have a fever too.

00:18:21.280 --> 00:18:24.040
Yes, I as well.

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:28.330
Milady...

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:29.670
What?

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:32.960
They are good friends, are they not?

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:35.800
It's not like they're my friends.

00:18:39.630 --> 00:18:42.430
Today turned out to be a good day.

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:51.270
All that is left is for Mr. Chrono
to recover from his illness soon.

00:19:20.380 --> 00:19:21.970
Rosette?

00:19:21.970 --> 00:19:24.640
Thank goodness.
You're feeling better, right?

00:19:24.640 --> 00:19:28.180
Chrono, you worry about yourself.

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:32.100
I'll be all right if I just rest a little more.

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:36.860
I'm sorry, Rosette.

00:19:41.530 --> 00:19:44.030
A charm to reduce fevers.

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:51.710
Hey, Chrono...

00:20:29.950 --> 00:20:31.200
Rosette...

00:20:34.870 --> 00:20:36.710
Sorry to have been so much trouble.

00:20:39.420 --> 00:20:42.510
Chrono, why, you!

00:20:44.300 --> 00:20:47.390
How dare you make me worry?!

00:20:47.390 --> 00:20:49.680
Oh, it was horrible!

00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:52.020
I wasn't sure what I was going to do!

00:20:52.020 --> 00:20:54.440
Why, you, you, you!

00:20:58.150 --> 00:20:59.860
Who is it?

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:02.780
Is Chrono here?
